Architecture: source all
Version: 7.4.13
Distribution: lmn74
Urgency: medium
Maintainer: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Changed-By: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Description:
 linuxmuster-webui7 - Next generation web-based management tool for linuxmuster.net v7.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-webui7 (7.4.13) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [security] [lmn_linbo4] Avoid path traversal in the config/ and vdi/
     routes.
   * [lmn_linbo4] LINBO group names are validated: the list only shows
     the start.conf whose group name is valid, and a duplicated group
     can not be given a name sophomorix-device would refuse (. and +).
   * [lmn_common] The credentials sent to linuxmuster-api are encoded as
     UTF-8: requests encoded them as Latin-1, which can not carry a
     password like €uro123. Needs linuxmuster-api 7.4.14 (#47).
   * [lmn_common] A linuxmuster-api request that times out says so, and
     that the operation may have been applied anyway, instead of asking
     to log in again. Connecting times out after 3 s, answering after
     10 s, 30 s for the password changes; reading the quotas has no
     time limit any more.
   * [lmn_common] The log viewer reads its offset in characters, as the
     frontend sends it: a log holding non-ASCII characters ended with
     "Server error occured". Fix #294, reported by @derdennis1012.
   * [lmn_settings] [lmn_users] A refused request answers 403 instead of
     failing with a 500.
   * [lmn_auth] [lmn_users] [lmn_session_new] Password errors stay
     displayed until closed, so a long password policy message can be
     read.
   * Schoolclasses and session members are sorted in natural order by
     linuxmuster-tools (5a, 10b, then abitur).
   * [packaging] Depends on linuxmuster-tools7 (>= 7.4.19).
